  "description": "The Sommet Carbon is a confidence inspiring 160mm enduro bike.\n\nThe Sommet handles technical downhills with ease, thanks to the modern aggressive geometry. Take your riding to the limits on your favourite trail or reach for the podium at your local enduro, the Sommet is with you all the way.\n\nThe Sommet CRS geometry is backed up by a slick performing components package. Including 170mm Fox Float 36 Performance forks, 160mm Fox Float DPX2 Performance shock that pivots on a sealed upper bearing, Shimano XT/SLX 1×12 gearing and SLX7120 4 piston hydraulic disc brakes. Finished off with the high performance Maxxis 3C Tubeless ready tyres mounted on DT Swiss E1700 30 wheelset. No matter where you ride, the Sommet CRS will never be out of its depth.\n\nModern carbon frame with boost spacing and aggressive geometry\n\nShimano SLX 7120 4 piston brakes with 203mm rotors\n\nShimano XT/SLX 1x12 speed groupset\n\nBrand-X Ascend Internal dropper post\n\nMRP ISCG Chain Guide\n\nMaxxis 3c Tubeless ready tyres with tubeless rim tape fitted and valves included",
